{
  "id": "python",
  "name": "Python / pip / pyenv",
  "description": "Python / pip / pyenv 的研发配置、工具与依赖读取候选。",
  "verification": {
    "level": "documentation",
    "toolVersions": [
      "pip stable",
      "pyenv current"
    ],
    "checkedAt": "2026-10-03"
  },
  "notes": [
    "pip 配置可含 index 认证 URL；netrc/keyring、site 配置、解释器/venv 根需另外配置。",
    "pyenv 不等于 pyenv-win；安装、wheel 构建/缓存和环境写入不是读取模板授权。"
  ],
